(function(E){ const x = E["exam-01"] = E["exam-01"] || {units:{}}; (x.units = x.units || {})["x01-l1"] = {"id":"x01-l1","patterns":["L1-clubs","PARA-money","PARA-time"],"title":{"en":"Listening Part 1: a course enquiry","tr":"Listening Part 1: kurs hakkında bilgi alma","fa":"Listening Part 1: پرس‌وجو درباره‌ی یک دوره"},"objective":{"en":"In this lesson you will learn to complete a table and notes while two people talk about booking a course: follow the table row by row, catch a price or a detail that changes, and write only the missing word.","tr":"Bu derste iki kişi bir kursa kayıt hakkında konuşurken bir tabloyu ve notları doldurmayı öğreneceksin: tabloyu satır satır takip edecek, değişen bir fiyatı ya da bilgiyi yakalayacak ve yalnızca eksik kelimeyi yazacaksın.","fa":"در این درس یاد می‌گیری وقتی دو نفر درباره‌ی ثبت‌نام در یک دوره حرف می‌زنند، یک جدول و یادداشت‌ها را کامل کنی: جدول را ردیف به ردیف دنبال کنی، قیمت یا اطلاعاتی را که عوض می‌شود بگیری و فقط کلمه‌ی جاافتاده را بنویسی."},"sessions":[["explain"],["drill"],["exit"]],"explain":{"title":{"en":"Listening Part 1: a course enquiry","tr":"Listening Part 1: kurs hakkında bilgi alma","fa":"Listening Part 1: پرس‌وجو درباره‌ی یک دوره"},"objective":{"en":"In this lesson you will learn to complete a table and notes while two people talk about booking a course: follow the table row by row, catch a price or a detail that changes, and write only the missing word.","tr":"Bu derste iki kişi bir kursa kayıt hakkında konuşurken bir tabloyu ve notları doldurmayı öğreneceksin: tabloyu satır satır takip edecek, değişen bir fiyatı ya da bilgiyi yakalayacak ve yalnızca eksik kelimeyi yazacaksın.","fa":"در این درس یاد می‌گیری وقتی دو نفر درباره‌ی ثبت‌نام در یک دوره حرف می‌زنند، یک جدول و یادداشت‌ها را کامل کنی: جدول را ردیف به ردیف دنبال کنی، قیمت یا اطلاعاتی را که عوض می‌شود بگیری و فقط کلمه‌ی جاافتاده را بنویسی."},"stats":[{"label":{"en":"Questions","tr":"Soru","fa":"سؤال"},"value":"10"},{"label":{"en":"Speakers","tr":"Konuşan","fa":"گوینده"},"value":"2"},{"label":{"en":"Word limit","tr":"Kelime sınırı","fa":"سقف کلمه"},"value":{"en":"1 word / number","tr":"1 kelime / sayı","fa":"۱ کلمه / عدد"}}],"context":{"eyebrow":{"en":"1 The context","tr":"1 Bağlam","fa":"۱ بافت"},"head":{"en":"This exam: a sailing centre","tr":"Bu sınav: bir yelken merkezi","fa":"این آزمون: یک مرکز قایقرانی"},"intro":{"en":"Part 1 is always an everyday conversation in which one person needs information. In this exam it is a course booking, the most frequent Part 1 situation. Learn the words on the card first: most answers are said in other words.","tr":"Part 1 her zaman birinin bilgiye ihtiyaç duyduğu günlük bir konuşmadır. Bu sınavda konu bir kurs kaydı; Part 1’de en sık çıkan durum. Önce karttaki kelimeleri öğren: cevapların çoğu başka kelimelerle söylenir.","fa":"Part 1 همیشه یک گفتگوی روزمره است که در آن یک نفر به اطلاعات نیاز دارد. در این آزمون موضوع ثبت‌نام در یک دوره است، یعنی پرتکرارترین موقعیت Part 1. اول کلمه‌های کارت را یاد بگیر: بیشتر جواب‌ها با کلمه‌های دیگری گفته می‌شوند."},"technique":{"en":"2 The technique","tr":"2 Teknik","fa":"۲ تکنیک"},"labels":{"asks":{"en":"What this part is about","tr":"Bu kısım ne hakkında","fa":"این بخش درباره‌ی چیست"},"fields":{"en":"Headings you will see","tr":"Göreceğin başlıklar","fa":"عنوان‌هایی که می‌بینی"},"words":{"en":"Words that carry the answers","tr":"Cevabı taşıyan kelimeler","fa":"کلمه‌هایی که جواب را می‌آورند"},"a":{"en":"On the paper","tr":"Kâğıtta","fa":"روی برگه"},"b":{"en":"What you hear or read","tr":"Duyduğun ya da okuduğun","fa":"چیزی که می‌شنوی یا می‌خوانی"},"traps":{"en":"Traps","tr":"Tuzaklar","fa":"دام‌ها"},"example":{"en":"Example","tr":"Örnek","fa":"نمونه"},"ideas":{"en":"Ideas","tr":"Fikirler","fa":"ایده‌ها"}},"cards":[{"id":"x01-l1-ctx","exam":true,"patterns":["L1-clubs","PARA-money","PARA-time"],"often":{"pattern":"L1-clubs","n":8,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 8 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 8’inde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۸ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}},"title":{"en":"Booking a sailing course","tr":"Bir yelken kursuna kayıt","fa":"ثبت‌نام در یک دوره‌ی قایقرانی بادبانی"},"asks":{"en":"A caller asks a sailing centre about its adult courses. A table compares three courses (what you learn, the cost, other information); then notes give practical details for the first day.","tr":"Biri bir yelken merkezini arayıp yetişkin kurslarını soruyor. Bir tablo üç kursu karşılaştırıyor (ne öğrenirsin, ücret, diğer bilgiler); ardından notlar ilk gün için pratik ayrıntılar veriyor.","fa":"یک نفر به یک مرکز قایقرانی زنگ می‌زند و درباره‌ی دوره‌های بزرگسالان می‌پرسد. یک جدول سه دوره را مقایسه می‌کند (چه یاد می‌گیری، هزینه، اطلاعات دیگر)؛ بعد یادداشت‌ها جزئیات عملی روز اول را می‌دهند."},"fields":["Course","What you learn","Cost","Other information","Day","Age limit","What to wear","Parking","Form to bring","Instructor"],"words":[{"a":"taster session","b":"a single afternoon to try it","tr":"deneme dersi","fa":"جلسه‌ی آزمایشی"},{"a":"cost","b":"it’s ... pounds / the standard price is","tr":"ücret","fa":"هزینه"},{"a":"early-booking price","b":"if you book before ... / book early and pay less","tr":"erken kayıt fiyatı","fa":"قیمت ثبت‌نام زودهنگام"},{"a":"including hire of","b":"that includes the hire of","tr":"... kiralama dahil","fa":"شامل کرایه‌ی ..."},{"a":"aged ... or over","b":"anyone from ... up / you must be at least","tr":"... yaş ve üstü","fa":"... سال و بالاتر"},{"a":"slipway","b":"the ramp where boats go into the water","tr":"kızak (tekne rampası)","fa":"سرسره‌ی قایق (رمپ ورود به آب)"},{"a":"turns over","b":"capsizes","tr":"alabora olmak","fa":"واژگون شدن قایق"},{"a":"must have done","b":"you need to have done ... first","tr":"önceden ... yapmış olmalı","fa":"باید قبلاً ... را گذرانده باشی"},{"a":"members only","b":"it’s just for people who have joined","tr":"yalnızca üyeler","fa":"فقط اعضا"},{"a":"wear","b":"you should have on / put on","tr":"giymek","fa":"پوشیدن"},{"a":"instructor","b":"the person who teaches you","tr":"eğitmen","fa":"مربی"}],"traps":[{"en":"A price, then a cheaper one: \"Normally it’s sixty pounds... for members it’s forty-eight.\" Check who the caller is before you write.","tr":"Önce bir fiyat, sonra daha ucuzu: \"Normalde altmış pound... üyeler için kırk sekiz.\" Yazmadan önce arayanın kim olduğuna bak.","fa":"اول یک قیمت، بعد یک قیمت ارزان‌تر: «معمولاً شصت پوند است... برای اعضا چهل‌وهشت». قبل از نوشتن ببین تماس‌گیرنده کیست."},{"en":"An old detail is corrected: \"It says the third here... no, sorry, that’s last year’s date. It’s the fifth now.\" Write the corrected one.","tr":"Eski bir bilgi düzeltilir: \"Burada ayın üçü yazıyor... yok, pardon, o geçen yılın tarihi. Artık beşi.\" Düzeltilmiş olanı yaz.","fa":"یک مورد قدیمی اصلاح می‌شود: «این‌جا نوشته سوم... نه، ببخشید، این تاریخ پارسال است. الان پنجم است». شکل اصلاح‌شده را بنویس."},{"en":"A word is already printed: \"tie the main ___\". Write only the missing word (knots), not \"main knots\".","tr":"Bir kelime zaten yazılı: \"tie the main ___\". Yalnızca eksik kelimeyi yaz (knots), \"main knots\" değil.","fa":"یک کلمه از قبل چاپ شده: «tie the main ___». فقط کلمه‌ی جاافتاده را بنویس (knots)، نه «main knots»."}],"example":{"lines":[["Assistant","The beginners’ lessons were on Tuesdays last year."],["Caller","Are they still?"],["Assistant","No, they’ve moved to Thursdays, because the lake is quieter then."]],"item":"Beginners’ lessons: every ___","answer":"Thursday","why":{"en":"Tuesday was last year. \"They’ve moved to Thursdays\" is the detail now.","tr":"Salı geçen yıldı. \"Perşembeye taşındı\" şimdiki bilgi.","fa":"سه‌شنبه مال پارسال بود. «به پنجشنبه‌ها منتقل شده» اطلاعاتِ الان است."}}},{"id":"L1-clubs","ctx":["L1-clubs"],"title":{"en":"Joining a club, class or course","tr":"Bir kulübe, derse ya da kursa katılmak","fa":"ثبت‌نام در باشگاه، کلاس یا دوره"},"asks":{"en":"Someone calls or visits to join a club, a class or a holiday course. The notes collect the course details: when, where, how much, what to bring and who to contact.","tr":"Biri bir kulübe, derse ya da tatil kursuna katılmak için arar ya da gelir. Notlar kursun ayrıntılarını toplar: ne zaman, nerede, ne kadar, ne getirmeli ve kime ulaşmalı.","fa":"کسی زنگ می‌زند یا حضوری می‌آید تا در یک باشگاه، کلاس یا دوره‌ی تعطیلات ثبت‌نام کند. یادداشت‌ها جزئیات دوره را جمع می‌کنند: کی، کجا، چقدر، چه باید آورد و با چه کسی تماس گرفت."},"fields":["Name of course / club","Day and time","Venue / meeting point","Cost per session / per term","Membership fee","What to bring","Level / experience needed","Contact name"],"words":[{"a":"fee","b":"it costs / you pay","tr":"ücret","fa":"هزینه؛ شهریه"},{"a":"per session","b":"each time you come","tr":"ders başına","fa":"برای هر جلسه"},{"a":"membership","b":"joining the club for the year","tr":"üyelik","fa":"عضویت"},{"a":"discount","b":"members pay less / it's reduced for","tr":"indirim","fa":"تخفیف"},{"a":"beginners","b":"if you've never done it before","tr":"yeni başlayanlar","fa":"مبتدی‌ها"},{"a":"equipment provided","b":"we lend you one / you don't need your own","tr":"ekipman sağlanır","fa":"تجهیزات را می‌دهند"},{"a":"bring","b":"make sure you have / you'll need","tr":"getirmek","fa":"آوردن"},{"a":"meeting point","b":"we all meet outside / we start from","tr":"buluşma noktası","fa":"محل قرار"},{"a":"term","b":"the course runs for ten weeks","tr":"dönem","fa":"ترم"},{"a":"taster session","b":"a free first class to try it","tr":"deneme dersi","fa":"جلسه‌ی آزمایشی"},{"a":"age group","b":"it's for children aged 8 to 12","tr":"yaş grubu","fa":"گروه سنی"},{"a":"deposit","b":"pay something now to keep your place","tr":"kapora","fa":"بیعانه"}],"traps":[{"en":"Two prices: the full price and a price for members, students or children. Check who the caller is before you write.","tr":"İki fiyat: tam fiyat ve üyeler, öğrenciler ya da çocuklar için bir fiyat. Yazmadan önce arayanın kim olduğuna bak.","fa":"دو قیمت: قیمت کامل و قیمتی برای اعضا، دانشجوها یا بچه‌ها. قبل از نوشتن ببین تماس‌گیرنده کیست."},{"en":"The class moves: \"it used to be on Tuesdays, but this term it’s on Thursdays\". Write where and when it is now.","tr":"Ders yer ya da gün değiştirir: \"eskiden salı günleriydi ama bu dönem perşembe\". Şimdiki yeri ve zamanı yaz.","fa":"کلاس جابه‌جا می‌شود: «قبلاً سه‌شنبه‌ها بود، ولی این ترم پنجشنبه‌هاست». جا و زمانِ فعلی را بنویس."},{"en":"Things to bring: one item is \"provided\" or \"optional\". Write only what the caller must bring.","tr":"Getirilecek şeyler: bir eşya \"sağlanır\" ya da \"isteğe bağlı\" olur. Yalnızca arayanın mutlaka getirmesi gerekeni yaz.","fa":"چیزهایی که باید آورد: یکی از وسیله‌ها را «می‌دهند» یا «اختیاری» است. فقط چیزی را بنویس که تماس‌گیرنده حتماً باید بیاورد."}],"example":{"lines":[["Secretary","Sessions are on Saturday mornings, and each one is twelve pounds."],["Caller","Is that the same for everyone?"],["Secretary","No, if you’re under eighteen it’s eight pounds."],["Caller","I’m seventeen, so that’s me."]],"item":"Cost per session: £___","answer":"8","why":{"en":"Twelve pounds is the full price. The caller is seventeen, so the under-eighteen price is the answer.","tr":"On iki pound tam fiyat. Arayan on yedi yaşında, yani cevap on sekiz yaş altı fiyatı.","fa":"دوازده پوند قیمت کامل است. تماس‌گیرنده هفده سال دارد، پس جواب قیمتِ زیر هجده سال است."}},"general":true,"patterns":["L1-clubs"],"often":{"pattern":"L1-clubs","n":8,"of":40,"label":{"en":"Comes up often in the real exam: 8 of the last 40 tests","tr":"Gerçek sınavda sık çıkar: son 40 sınavın 8’inde","fa":"در آزمون واقعی زیاد می‌آید: در ۸ آزمون از ۴۰ آزمونِ اخیر"}}}]},"points":[{"eyebrow":{"en":"In the exam","tr":"Sınavda","fa":"در آزمون"},"head":{"en":"Ten gaps, two speakers, one play","tr":"On boşluk, iki konuşan, tek dinleme","fa":"ده جای خالی، دو گوینده، یک بار پخش"},"body":{"en":"Questions 1-6 are a table, Questions 7-10 are notes. You get about 30 seconds to read before each half, and you hear the recording once. The answers come in question order. Table: ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER. Notes: ONE WORD ONLY.","tr":"Soru 1-6 bir tablo, Soru 7-10 notlar. Her yarıdan önce okumak için yaklaşık 30 saniyen var ve kaydı bir kez duyarsın. Cevaplar soru sırasıyla gelir. Tablo: ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER. Notlar: ONE WORD ONLY.","fa":"سؤال‌های ۱ تا ۶ یک جدول‌اند و سؤال‌های ۷ تا ۱۰ یادداشت. قبل از هر نیمه حدود ۳۰ ثانیه برای خواندن وقت داری و فایل را فقط یک بار می‌شنوی. جواب‌ها به ترتیب سؤال‌ها می‌آیند. جدول: ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER. یادداشت‌ها: ONE WORD ONLY."}},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The method","tr":"Yöntem","fa":"روش"},"head":{"en":"Four steps for a table","tr":"Tablo için dört adım","fa":"چهار قدم برای جدول"},"steps":[{"en":"Read the column headings and the first word of each row. The row name tells you where you are.","tr":"Sütun başlıklarını ve her satırın ilk kelimesini oku. Satırın adı nerede olduğunu söyler.","fa":"عنوان ستون‌ها و اولین کلمه‌ی هر ردیف را بخوان. اسم ردیف می‌گوید کجای جدول هستی."},{"en":"For each gap, decide what it needs: a number, a day, a thing or an action.","tr":"Her boşluk için ne gerektiğine karar ver: sayı, gün, eşya ya da eylem.","fa":"برای هر جای خالی تصمیم بگیر چه می‌خواهد: عدد، روز، چیز یا کار."},{"en":"Listen for words that change a detail: but, actually, sorry, this year, now.","tr":"Bir bilgiyi değiştiren kelimelere kulak ver: but, actually, sorry, this year, now.","fa":"به کلمه‌هایی که اطلاعات را عوض می‌کنند گوش بده: but، actually، sorry، this year، now."},{"en":"Write numbers as figures. Check the word limit and the spelling.","tr":"Sayıları rakamla yaz. Kelime sınırını ve yazımı kontrol et.","fa":"عددها را با رقم بنویس. سقف کلمه و املا را چک کن."}]},{"eyebrow":{"en":"The trap","tr":"Tuzak","fa":"دام"},"head":{"en":"Read the words around the gap","tr":"Boşluğun etrafındaki kelimeleri oku","fa":"کلمه‌های دور جای خالی را بخوان"},"body":{"en":"A word printed next to the gap is part of the answer line already. \"aged ___ or over\" needs only the number; \"the main ___\" needs only the noun. Writing it again can break the word limit.","tr":"Boşluğun yanında yazılı olan kelime zaten satırın parçası. \"aged ___ or over\" yalnızca sayıyı ister; \"the main ___\" yalnızca ismi ister. Onu tekrar yazmak kelime sınırını aşmana yol açabilir.","fa":"کلمه‌ای که کنار جای خالی چاپ شده، از قبل جزء همان خط است. «aged ___ or over» فقط عدد می‌خواهد؛ «the main ___» فقط اسم می‌خواهد. اگر دوباره بنویسی‌اش، ممکن است از سقف کلمه بیشتر شود."}}],"example":{"eyebrow":{"en":"Worked example","tr":"Çözümlü örnek","fa":"مثال حل‌شده"},"head":{"en":"One table gap, step by step","tr":"Bir tablo boşluğu, adım adım","fa":"یک جای خالی جدول، قدم به قدم"},"instruction":"Complete the table below. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.","item":"Junior course · held in the ___ pool","lines":[["Assistant","The junior lessons used to be in the main pool."],["Caller","Is that where they are now?"],["Assistant","Not any more. Since the repairs they’re in the training pool, at the back of the building."]],"answer":"training","walk":[{"en":"Before you listen: the row is Junior course, and the gap needs a word that describes a pool.","tr":"Dinlemeden önce: satır Junior course ve boşluk bir havuzu tarif eden bir kelime istiyor.","fa":"قبل از گوش دادن: ردیف Junior course است و جای خالی کلمه‌ای می‌خواهد که یک استخر را توصیف کند."},{"en":"You hear \"main pool\" first, but \"used to\" and \"not any more\" tell you it changed.","tr":"Önce \"main pool\" duyuyorsun ama \"used to\" ve \"not any more\" bunun değiştiğini söylüyor.","fa":"اول «main pool» را می‌شنوی، اما «used to» و «not any more» می‌گویند عوض شده."},{"en":"Write training. \"pool\" is already printed, so one word is enough.","tr":"training yaz. \"pool\" zaten yazılı, tek kelime yeter.","fa":"training را بنویس. «pool» از قبل چاپ شده، پس یک کلمه کافی است."}]},"quick":{"prompt":"Notes: \"Bring a ___ (ONE WORD ONLY)\". You hear: \"Bring a towel. There’s no need for a padlock, the lockers are free.\" What do you write?","options":["padlock","towel","towel and padlock"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"The padlock is ruled out (\"no need\"), and two words would break the limit.","tr":"Asma kilit dışarıda bırakılıyor (\"no need\") ve iki kelime sınırı aşar.","fa":"قفل کنار گذاشته می‌شود («no need») و دو کلمه از سقف بیشتر است."}},"remember":{"en":"Know the row, write the final detail, and never repeat a printed word.","tr":"Satırı bil, son bilgiyi yaz ve yazılı bir kelimeyi asla tekrarlama.","fa":"ردیف را بدان، اطلاعات نهایی را بنویس و هیچ‌وقت کلمه‌ی چاپ‌شده را تکرار نکن."},"type":"explain","id":"c-x01-l1-e","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-01","unit":"x01-l1"},"drill":{"type":"drill","skill":"listening","part":"Listening Part 1","title":{"en":"Hollins Water Sailing Centre","tr":"Hollins Water Yelken Merkezi","fa":"مرکز قایقرانی هالینز واتر"},"timed":8,"ctx":["L1-clubs"],"script":[{"who":"Assistant","line":"Good morning, Hollins Water Sailing Centre. How can I help?"},{"who":"Caller","line":"Hi. I'm thinking of learning to sail this summer, and I wanted to ask about your courses for adults."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Of course. We have three adult courses at the moment, and most people start with the first one, the taster session."},{"who":"Caller","line":"What's that exactly?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"It's a single afternoon on the water with an instructor. You won't learn everything, obviously, but by the end you'll understand the basics of steering, and you'll know whether sailing is for you."},{"who":"Caller","line":"And how much is it?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"It's thirty-five pounds, and that includes the hire of a lifejacket and a wetsuit."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Fine. Which day are they?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"We used to run them on Saturday afternoons, but the lake gets very busy then, so this year they're all on Sundays."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Sundays. OK."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"After that, the next step is a course called Start Sailing. That's two full days, and it covers everything you need to go out on your own in a small boat. The instructors show you how to launch the boat from the slipway, how to tie the main knots and what to do if it turns over."},{"who":"Caller","line":"That's the one I'm really interested in. What does it cost?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"The standard price is a hundred and ninety pounds. But if you book before the end of April, there's an early-booking price of a hundred and seventy-five."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Well, it's only the beginning of April now, so I'll book this week."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Then for you it'll be a hundred and seventy-five."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Is there an age limit? My nephew might want to come with me."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Let me check. It says sixteen here... no, sorry, I'm looking at last year's leaflet. We lowered it in January. It's fourteen now."},{"who":"Caller","line":"That's good, he's fifteen."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Then that's no problem. Younger children have their own club on Wednesday evenings."},{"who":"Caller","line":"And is there anything after Start Sailing?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Yes, there's the Improver course. That one is about sailing in stronger winds, and it also teaches you how to race against other boats. It costs two hundred and ten pounds, and you need to have done Start Sailing first, or something similar at another centre."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Right. I'll think about that one later."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Can I give you some general information now, so you know what to expect on the day?"},{"who":"Caller","line":"Yes, please."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"First, clothing. Most people bring a sweatshirt to wear under the wetsuit, because it can be cold on the water even in summer. On your feet, please wear old trainers. People often turn up in sandals, but they come off in the water, so we don't let anyone sail in them."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Old trainers. I've got some of those."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Now, parking. The main car park by the clubhouse is for members only, I'm afraid. Students should use the field next to the boathouse. It's free, and it's only a two-minute walk."},{"who":"Caller","line":"That's easy."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Before your first session, you'll need to fill in a form. It's mainly your contact details, but there's also a section on your health. It's called the medical form, and you can download it from our website."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Do I need to send it back before I come?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"No, just bring it with you on the first morning and give it to your instructor."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Who will that be?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"For Start Sailing in May, it's usually Ruth Pettigrew. She's been teaching here for over ten years."},{"who":"Caller","line":"How do you spell her surname?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"P-E-T-T-I-G-R-E-W. Two Ts in the middle."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Thanks. And can I book online?"},{"who":"Assistant","line":"Yes, or I can take your details now if you like."},{"who":"Caller","line":"Online is fine. Thanks very much for your help."},{"who":"Assistant","line":"You're welcome. Enjoy your sailing."}],"table":{"title":"Hollins Water Sailing Centre: adult courses","headers":["Course","What you learn","Cost","Other information"],"rows":[["Taster session","the basics of (1) ___","£35, including hire of lifejacket and wetsuit","held on (2) ___ afternoons"],["Start Sailing","how to (3) ___ the boat from the slipway; main knots","(4) £___ if booked before the end of April","for people aged (5) ___ or over"],["Improver","sailing in stronger (6) ___; racing","£210","must have done Start Sailing first"]]},"notes":{"title":"General information","lines":["Clothing: wear a sweatshirt under the wetsuit and old (7) ___ on your feet","Parking: use the (8) ___ next to the boathouse","Before the first session: fill in the (9) ___ form and bring it on the first morning","Instructor for May courses: Ruth (10) ___"]},"groups":[{"instruction":"Questions 1-6. Complete the table below. Write ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.","qtype":"table","questions":[{"n":1,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Taster session · What you learn: the basics of ___","accept":["steering"],"limit":1,"evidence":"the basics of steering","trap":["TR-printed"],"why":{"en":"\"By the end you’ll understand the basics of steering.\" \"the basics of\" is printed, so write one word.","tr":"\"Sonunda dümen kullanmanın temellerini anlarsın.\" \"the basics of\" yazılı, tek kelime yaz.","fa":"«آخرش اصولِ هدایت قایق را می‌فهمی». «the basics of» چاپ شده، پس یک کلمه بنویس."}},{"n":2,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Taster session · Other information: held on ___ afternoons","accept":["Sunday","Sundays"],"limit":1,"evidence":"this year they're all on Sundays","trap":["TR-selfcorrect"],"why":{"en":"Saturdays was the old day. \"This year they’re all on Sundays.\"","tr":"Cumartesi eski gündü. \"Bu yıl hepsi pazar günü.\"","fa":"شنبه روزِ قبلی بود. «امسال همه‌شان یکشنبه‌هاست»."}},{"n":3,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Start Sailing · What you learn: how to ___ the boat from the slipway","accept":["launch"],"limit":1,"evidence":"how to launch the boat from the slipway","trap":["TR-paraphrase"],"why":{"en":"\"How to launch the boat from the slipway\": put it into the water.","tr":"\"Tekneyi kızaktan suya indirmeyi\": yani suya koymayı.","fa":"«اینکه قایق را از سرسره به آب بیندازی»: یعنی آن را وارد آب کنی."}},{"n":4,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Start Sailing · Cost: £___ if booked before the end of April","accept":["175"],"limit":1,"evidence":"for you it'll be a hundred and seventy-five","trap":["TR-price"],"why":{"en":"£190 is the standard price. He books in early April, so the early-booking price applies: 175.","tr":"190 £ normal fiyat. Nisan başında kayıt oluyor, yani erken kayıt fiyatı geçerli: 175.","fa":"۱۹۰ پوند قیمت عادی است. او اوایل آوریل ثبت‌نام می‌کند، پس قیمت زودهنگام حساب می‌شود: ۱۷۵."}},{"n":5,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Start Sailing · Other information: for people aged ___ or over","accept":["14","fourteen"],"limit":1,"evidence":"It's fourteen now","trap":["TR-selfcorrect"],"why":{"en":"Sixteen is on last year’s leaflet. She corrects it: \"It’s fourteen now.\"","tr":"On altı geçen yılın broşüründe. Düzeltiyor: \"Artık on dört.\"","fa":"شانزده مال بروشور پارسال است. اصلاحش می‌کند: «الان چهارده است»."}},{"n":6,"kind":"gap","prompt":"Improver · What you learn: sailing in stronger ___; racing","accept":["winds"],"limit":1,"evidence":"sailing in stronger winds","trap":["TR-printed","TR-plural"],"why":{"en":"\"Stronger\" is printed. Write winds, with the s you hear.","tr":"\"Stronger\" yazılı. Duyduğun s ile winds yaz.","fa":"«stronger» چاپ شده. winds را با همان s که می‌شنوی بنویس."}}]},{"instruction":"Questions 7-10. Complete the notes below. Write ONE WORD ONLY for each answer.","qtype":"note","questions":[{"n":7,"kind":"gap","prompt":"General information · Clothing: old ___ on your feet","accept":["trainers"],"limit":1,"evidence":"please wear old trainers","trap":["TR-paraphrase"],"why":{"en":"Sandals are mentioned but not allowed. \"Please wear old trainers.\"","tr":"Sandaletten söz ediliyor ama izin yok. \"Lütfen eski spor ayakkabı giyin.\"","fa":"از صندل حرف می‌زند ولی اجازه ندارند. «لطفاً کفش ورزشی کهنه بپوش»."}},{"n":8,"kind":"gap","prompt":"General information · Parking: use the ___ next to the boathouse","accept":["field"],"limit":1,"evidence":"use the field next to the boathouse","trap":["TR-paraphrase"],"why":{"en":"The main car park is for members only. Students use \"the field next to the boathouse\".","tr":"Ana otopark yalnızca üyeler için. Öğrenciler \"kayıkhanenin yanındaki çayırı\" kullanır.","fa":"پارکینگ اصلی فقط مال اعضاست. شاگردها از «زمینِ کنار قایق‌خانه» استفاده می‌کنند."}},{"n":9,"kind":"gap","prompt":"General information · Fill in the ___ form and bring it on the first morning","accept":["medical"],"limit":1,"evidence":"It's called the medical form","why":{"en":"\"It’s called the medical form.\" \"form\" is printed, so write one word.","tr":"\"Adı sağlık formu.\" \"form\" yazılı, tek kelime yaz.","fa":"«اسمش فرم پزشکی است». «form» چاپ شده، پس یک کلمه بنویس."}},{"n":10,"kind":"gap","prompt":"General information · Instructor for May courses: Ruth ___","accept":["Pettigrew"],"limit":1,"evidence":"P-E-T-T-I-G-R-E-W","trap":["TR-spell"],"why":{"en":"Spelled P-E-T-T-I-G-R-E-W: two Ts. A spelled name must match every letter.","tr":"P-E-T-T-I-G-R-E-W diye harf harf: iki T. Harf harf söylenen isim aynen yazılmalı.","fa":"حرف به حرف: P-E-T-T-I-G-R-E-W، با دو T. اسمی که هجی می‌شود باید حرف به حرف درست باشد."}}]}],"audio":{"voices":{"Announcer":{"accent":"British (standard Southern)","gender":"M","tts":{"engine":"kokoro","voice":"bm_george"},"role":"Recorded rubric"},"Assistant":{"accent":"British (Southern English)","gender":"F","tts":{"engine":"kokoro","voice":"bf_emma"},"role":"Sailing-centre assistant"},"Caller":{"accent":"Australian","gender":"M","tts":{"engine":"kokoro","voice":"bm_lewis","fallback":true,"note":"Australian wanted; no free Australian voice yet"},"role":"Caller who wants a course"}},"sequence":[{"type":"announcer","text":"Part 1. You will hear a telephone conversation between a woman who works at a sailing centre and a man who wants to learn to sail. First, you have some time to look at Questions 1 to 6."},{"type":"pause","seconds":30,"note":"reading time, Questions 1-6"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Now listen carefully and answer Questions 1 to 6."},{"type":"lines","from":0,"to":21,"note":"phone line: light telephone filter on both voices; a short ring before line 0"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at Questions 7 to 10."},{"type":"pause","seconds":30,"note":"reading time, Questions 7-10"},{"type":"announcer","text":"Now listen and answer Questions 7 to 10."},{"type":"lines","from":22,"to":38},{"type":"announcer","text":"That is the end of Part 1. You now have half a minute to check your answers.","after":30}]},"id":"c-x01-l1-d","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-01","unit":"x01-l1"},"exit":{"type":"exit","items":[{"tests":"word","point":1,"prompt":"In the recording, \"the ramp where boats go into the water\" is called the...","options":["slipway","boathouse","clubhouse"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"A slipway is the ramp into the water. The boathouse is where boats are kept.","tr":"Slipway suya inen rampadır. Boathouse teknelerin durduğu yerdir.","fa":"slipway رمپی است که به آب می‌رسد. boathouse جایی است که قایق‌ها را نگه می‌دارند."}},{"tests":"paraphrase","point":1,"prompt":"The table says \"including hire of wetsuit\". Which sentence means the same?","options":["You can buy a wetsuit at reception.","Bring your own wetsuit.","The price covers borrowing a wetsuit."],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"\"Hire\" = you borrow it for a fee; \"including\" = it is already in the price.","tr":"\"Hire\" = ücretle kiralamak; \"including\" = fiyata dahil.","fa":"«hire» یعنی در ازای پول قرض بگیری؛ «including» یعنی در قیمت حساب شده."}},{"tests":"method","point":2,"prompt":"The assistant is still talking about Start Sailing, and you have not heard the answer to Question 4 yet. What do you do?","options":["Move on to the Improver row","Keep listening on the Start Sailing row","Leave the table and read the notes"],"correct":1,"why":{"en":"Answers come in order, and the row name tells you where you are. Stay on the row until it ends.","tr":"Cevaplar sırayla gelir ve satır adı nerede olduğunu söyler. Satır bitene kadar orada kal.","fa":"جواب‌ها به ترتیب می‌آیند و اسم ردیف می‌گوید کجایی. تا ردیف تمام نشده، همان‌جا بمان."}},{"tests":"trap","point":2,"prompt":"Gap: \"lessons for children aged ___ to 12\". You hear: \"It says eight on the poster, but that’s wrong. We start at seven.\" What do you write?","options":["7","8","8 or 7"],"correct":0,"why":{"en":"The poster figure is corrected: \"We start at seven.\"","tr":"Afişteki rakam düzeltiliyor: \"Yediden başlıyoruz.\"","fa":"عدد پوستر اصلاح می‌شود: «از هفت سالگی شروع می‌کنیم»."}},{"tests":"trap","point":3,"prompt":"Gap: \"sailing on calm ___\" (ONE WORD ONLY). You hear: \"The first day is all about sailing on calm water.\" What do you write?","options":["calm water","sailing water","water"],"correct":2,"why":{"en":"\"calm\" is printed before the gap. Write only water.","tr":"\"calm\" boşluktan önce yazılı. Yalnızca water yaz.","fa":"«calm» قبل از جای خالی چاپ شده. فقط water را بنویس."}}],"id":"c-x01-l1-x","course":"ielts-exams","exam":"exam-01","unit":"x01-l1"}}; })(globalThis.IELTS_EXAMS = globalThis.IELTS_EXAMS || {});
